WEBVTT

01:14.420 --> 01:18.720
[Meet yourself]

01:19.180 --> 01:21.960
[Episode 13]

01:26.715 --> 01:28.295
I can't write...

01:31.825 --> 01:33.815
Out of inspiration today?

01:34.385 --> 01:36.615
Only inspiration can't
bring you a full-time job.

01:39.945 --> 01:41.335
I've already lost

01:42.025 --> 01:43.775
its inspiration for long.

01:44.225 --> 01:45.975
Then how could you complete it?

01:46.555 --> 01:48.135
I have to.

01:48.515 --> 01:49.775
But how?

01:50.995 --> 01:52.455
Based on my fortitude.

01:52.745 --> 01:53.745
Insistence.

01:54.355 --> 01:56.135
The zeal of burning my life.

01:58.555 --> 02:00.015
Sounds hot-blooded.

02:01.275 --> 02:02.655
And painful.

02:04.185 --> 02:06.015
A movie says that

02:06.875 --> 02:09.975
anguish is the soil of creation.

02:11.715 --> 02:12.715
I agree.

02:13.185 --> 02:15.015
What about water planting?

02:19.065 --> 02:20.175
Excuse me.

02:20.465 --> 02:23.095
It's a joke for I find
you're in bad mood.

02:23.625 --> 02:24.625
Well, it's funny.

02:25.305 --> 02:26.305
That's it.

02:27.715 --> 02:30.434
So you should tell us
more and more often.

02:30.435 --> 02:33.274
Though we can help
you nothing in writing,

02:33.275 --> 02:35.655
we can help you
improve your mood.

02:40.555 --> 02:41.895
I...

02:42.155 --> 02:43.735
I want to be a teacher.

02:44.305 --> 02:45.615
Change your career?

02:47.025 --> 02:49.935
I've written since the
last year of my college.

02:50.185 --> 02:52.335
After graduation, I became a full-time author.

02:53.235 --> 02:54.784
I was young at that time.

02:54.785 --> 02:56.615
In the beginning, I was robust

02:56.875 --> 02:58.024
and reckless.

02:58.025 --> 02:59.775
I could complete
nearly 20,000 characters each day.

03:00.155 --> 03:01.435
And earned some money.

03:01.745 --> 03:03.504
After writing for several years,

03:03.505 --> 03:05.744
I've developed some tricks.

03:05.745 --> 03:06.895
My style became better.

03:07.745 --> 03:09.895
So did my skills of telling stories.

03:10.555 --> 03:12.975
But I couldn't write so fast then.

03:14.305 --> 03:17.375
My favorite themes
are quite uncommon

03:17.905 --> 03:21.255
so they're not popular.

03:22.025 --> 03:24.154
No matter what plots I wrote,

03:24.155 --> 03:25.495
I was always criticized.

03:26.185 --> 03:28.495
I felt overwhelmed and frustrated

03:29.395 --> 03:30.855
and I didn't know what to do.

03:33.435 --> 03:36.234
Then I was thinking
to listen to my dad

03:36.235 --> 03:37.415
to find a normal job

03:38.155 --> 03:41.455
after I finish writing the book.

03:42.585 --> 03:44.695
But you love writing novels!

03:45.505 --> 03:47.815
But my parents
also worry about me.

03:48.185 --> 03:50.154
An unpopular author like me,

03:50.155 --> 03:52.815
I don't feel good about
myself of doing it well

03:53.505 --> 03:55.815
if I want to try another
unpopular theme.

03:56.785 --> 03:57.874
I don't know

03:57.875 --> 03:59.775
whether I could get a better future or not.

04:00.955 --> 04:03.615
Are my spring and
success waiting for me?

04:08.185 --> 04:11.175
Actually, I'm a tacky person.

04:12.145 --> 04:16.095
I want to earn so much
money, I want to be liked

04:16.505 --> 04:17.815
and also I want success.

04:19.145 --> 04:19.994
Who doesn't?

04:19.995 --> 04:21.095
Everyone is like so.

04:22.065 --> 04:23.065
That's it.

04:24.555 --> 04:26.615
You're the first writer I know.

04:26.945 --> 04:29.474
I used to believe you
didn't need to work

04:29.475 --> 04:31.474
and could be rich and free

04:31.475 --> 04:33.114
with so many readers' love.

04:33.115 --> 04:34.895
All of you guys should be happy.

04:36.825 --> 04:38.944
Few successful authors can.

04:38.945 --> 04:40.215
Very rare.

04:40.825 --> 04:42.794
Many people say online

04:42.795 --> 04:44.914
authors could earn so much money

04:44.915 --> 04:46.495
by selling copyrights every year.

04:46.795 --> 04:48.184
But they belong to the numerator,

04:48.185 --> 04:49.994
standing upper in the fraction.

04:49.995 --> 04:51.735
One in a million.

04:52.415 --> 04:53.114
I only belong to

04:53.115 --> 04:55.215
the denominator, still trying to support myself.

04:58.705 --> 05:01.535
But if you really can't,

05:02.385 --> 05:04.414
couldn't you tell your readers

05:04.415 --> 05:05.434
to suspend for a few days?

05:05.435 --> 05:06.895
Is it a big matter?

05:08.185 --> 05:09.185
Yes.

05:09.795 --> 05:12.895
Authors like me attract
readers by serializing.

05:13.705 --> 05:15.855
A few days?

05:16.945 --> 05:18.455
Only three days

05:19.945 --> 05:21.655
will crash the number of comments.

05:22.035 --> 05:23.944
Out of ranking,
revenue will be halved.

05:23.945 --> 05:25.255
Readers will soon run away.

05:26.065 --> 05:27.215
You suspend

05:27.475 --> 05:29.055
while others will update double.

05:30.355 --> 05:31.895
Then yours will become rubbish.

05:32.595 --> 05:33.944
But as long as your story is nice,

05:33.945 --> 05:35.895
readers will wait for you.

05:37.385 --> 05:39.375
But as long as you write well,

05:39.825 --> 05:41.455
readers will wait for you.

05:44.115 --> 05:46.855
It sounds like

05:47.145 --> 05:48.354
"as if I have 30 million".

05:48.355 --> 05:50.944
If so, I could get
a million annually

05:50.945 --> 05:52.015
for profits.

05:53.065 --> 05:54.815
"As long as I write well"...

05:55.675 --> 05:59.015
This premise has a huge gap

05:59.505 --> 06:00.944
between 99% of the authors.

06:00.945 --> 06:02.775
There's a natural moat.

06:04.435 --> 06:06.335
So whenever someone asks me

06:06.825 --> 06:09.295
about my job and my novels,

06:10.555 --> 06:15.375
I don't know how
and what to tell them.

06:17.915 --> 06:20.015
So it turns out like that.

06:20.305 --> 06:22.114
I have some thoughts.

06:22.115 --> 06:24.335
I don't know whether
they can help or not.

06:26.555 --> 06:28.935
I admire someone like you,

06:29.435 --> 06:31.535
having a favorite job

06:31.795 --> 06:33.775
and pouring zeal into it.

06:34.555 --> 06:37.215
Though you say you
love money and success,

06:38.035 --> 06:42.144
I still believe you
will earn nothing

06:42.145 --> 06:46.095
to complete the work
that could satisfy you

06:47.185 --> 06:50.994
and bring you fulfillment and excitement.

06:50.995 --> 06:52.135
Is that right?

06:55.915 --> 06:58.135
Because ardor has weight.

06:58.595 --> 07:01.695
It's absolutely not
something unimportant

07:02.945 --> 07:04.255
Then again.

07:05.115 --> 07:06.615
People like powerhouses.

07:07.385 --> 07:08.944
They love the guys

07:08.945 --> 07:11.495
who can be real with no flinch,

07:12.115 --> 07:13.815
no matter what difficulties

07:14.475 --> 07:16.055
and hardships they confront.

07:17.795 --> 07:19.655
Many people have heroic dreams

07:20.995 --> 07:23.415
but how many of them could be heroes?

07:26.675 --> 07:28.375
We're regular guys.

07:29.745 --> 07:32.415
We'll judge many
realistic factors

07:33.115 --> 07:35.255
when facing life choices.

07:36.235 --> 07:37.735
They're heavy.

07:40.995 --> 07:41.995
Damai.

07:42.475 --> 07:44.135
Don't blame yourself too much.

07:45.145 --> 07:47.055
No matter what decision you make,

07:47.825 --> 07:49.535
I'll always cheer for you.

07:51.915 --> 07:52.915
So do I.

07:56.675 --> 07:57.675
She is about to cry again.

07:58.875 --> 07:59.744
Have your meal first.

07:59.745 --> 08:00.855
It's getting cold.

08:15.305 --> 08:16.305
It's so yummy.

08:20.115 --> 08:21.255
It's yummy.

08:33.665 --> 08:34.544
Nana.

08:34.545 --> 08:35.544
Have a rest.

08:35.545 --> 08:36.895
I'll clean them tomorrow.

08:42.665 --> 08:44.495
Nana, what's going on?

08:49.025 --> 08:50.025
I'm fine.

08:51.785 --> 08:53.975
Why are you crying
after Damai feels better?

09:00.385 --> 09:01.385
I...

09:03.355 --> 09:04.615
I just think...

09:05.115 --> 09:06.495
I'm sorry for her.

09:22.145 --> 09:23.145
Nana.

09:24.475 --> 09:25.424
Hello.

09:25.425 --> 09:28.335
Well... did you wash
the sheet for me?

09:28.875 --> 09:30.474
I saw you put it in the laundry basket

09:30.475 --> 09:31.895
so I washed them together.

09:33.115 --> 09:34.144
Thank you.

09:34.145 --> 09:35.994
I thought to wash it.

09:35.995 --> 09:37.615
As I found someone was using it,

09:37.905 --> 09:39.424
I decided to wash it later.

09:39.425 --> 09:40.874
That's why I put it there.

09:40.875 --> 09:42.455
Sorry for troubling you.

09:43.265 --> 09:44.384
It doesn't matter.

09:44.385 --> 09:45.834
The washing machine helps us a lot.

09:45.835 --> 09:46.835
Not a big deal.

09:47.785 --> 09:49.215
Let me hang it.

09:52.235 --> 09:53.264
Thank you.

09:53.265 --> 09:54.074
Hold there.

09:54.075 --> 09:55.075
Okay.

09:56.235 --> 09:57.235
Come on.

10:01.385 --> 10:02.504
Damai, by the way.

10:02.505 --> 10:04.215
What's your job?

10:05.355 --> 10:07.624
I'm a freelancer.

10:07.625 --> 10:08.775
Freelancer?

10:10.025 --> 10:11.655
Designer?

10:12.625 --> 10:15.175
I saw you've always
stayed in your room

10:15.425 --> 10:17.815
Or an online live steamer?

10:19.355 --> 10:20.355
No.

10:21.625 --> 10:23.175
I write novels.

10:23.785 --> 10:25.455
Internet author?

10:26.785 --> 10:28.415
Keep it secret.

10:28.745 --> 10:29.714
Don't be modest!

10:29.715 --> 10:31.215
You're so awesome!

10:31.595 --> 10:32.874
Writing a composition

10:32.875 --> 10:35.144
has been my biggest
trouble since I was young.

10:35.145 --> 10:37.114
I always pieced up an 800-character article

10:37.115 --> 10:38.655
by all kinds of punctuation marks

10:39.115 --> 10:40.695
and mood particles.

10:41.385 --> 10:42.904
I was just reversed.

10:42.905 --> 10:45.354
I used to control myself
not to write over 800.

10:45.355 --> 10:46.784
Which website are your novels on?

10:46.785 --> 10:48.335
I want to read your works.

10:52.875 --> 10:54.594
Which type do you like?

10:54.595 --> 10:56.424
I can recommend some for you.

10:56.425 --> 10:58.815
Your interest should be prior.

10:59.115 --> 11:01.735
Most of my friends
write sweet love stories.

11:03.475 --> 11:04.544
It doesn't matter.

11:04.545 --> 11:08.695
But I prefer Kung Fu
stories and thrillers.

11:09.475 --> 11:11.594
But I just want to read your works.

11:11.595 --> 11:14.615
It's uneasy for me
to live with an author.

11:19.265 --> 11:22.375
Will you think I'm so gutless?

11:22.995 --> 11:24.095
No.

11:25.075 --> 11:26.095
You can read it.

11:26.385 --> 11:27.714
So which website are your novels on?

11:27.715 --> 11:28.624
I have no account.

11:28.625 --> 11:29.994
I need to register one first.

11:29.995 --> 11:31.194
You don't need to.

11:31.195 --> 11:32.234
I'll send you a file.

11:32.235 --> 11:33.504
You can read it by phone.

11:33.505 --> 11:34.954
How can I?

11:34.955 --> 11:36.664
I must pay for reading.

11:36.665 --> 11:37.855
It's fine.

11:38.115 --> 11:39.474
Only you can read it.

11:39.475 --> 11:40.855
Just don't send it to others.

11:42.195 --> 11:43.994
But I can't read for free.

11:43.995 --> 11:45.314
You don't.

11:45.315 --> 11:47.114
You've washed my sheet.

11:47.115 --> 11:48.264
The washing machine did it.

11:48.265 --> 11:49.424
It's not my work.

11:49.425 --> 11:50.935
Of course, it's yours.

11:56.145 --> 11:57.145
Let's go.

11:57.665 --> 11:58.904
What do you want for lunch?

11:58.905 --> 12:00.095
Let's eat together.

12:00.715 --> 12:01.544
Everything is okay.

12:01.545 --> 12:02.695
Are you off duty today?

12:02.995 --> 12:04.175
One leave per week.

12:04.905 --> 12:06.575
So what do you want?

12:07.875 --> 12:09.655
Anything. It depends on you.

12:10.315 --> 12:10.994
I...

12:10.995 --> 12:12.735
Shall I cook for you?

12:13.265 --> 12:14.535
Can you cook?

12:15.905 --> 12:16.714
God of Earth.

12:16.715 --> 12:18.714
What about my Monkey King Golden Bar?

12:18.715 --> 12:19.504
Monkey King.

12:19.505 --> 12:20.994
Your Golden Bar is excellent

12:20.995 --> 12:23.015
for it fits your hairstyle well!

12:26.955 --> 12:27.664
Sis!

12:27.665 --> 12:29.074
Warm yourself by the fire.

12:29.075 --> 12:30.075
Call her "Damai".

12:30.875 --> 12:31.424
Damai.

12:31.425 --> 12:32.361
I see.

12:32.385 --> 12:33.264
Sis Mai.

12:33.265 --> 12:34.375
Come and warm yourself.

12:37.475 --> 12:38.744
Damai, are you hungry?

12:38.745 --> 12:40.535
Baked sweet potatoes
and corns here.

12:41.355 --> 12:41.994
Have a seat!

12:41.995 --> 12:43.744
Let me introduce them to you.

12:43.745 --> 12:44.745
Come on.

12:47.115 --> 12:49.815
This is Ma Qiushan, Mr. Ma.

12:52.625 --> 12:53.625
Hello.

12:53.995 --> 12:56.354
The one eating
corns is Hu Youyu.

12:56.355 --> 12:57.375
He's a singer.

12:58.235 --> 12:59.424
I'm a musician.

12:59.425 --> 13:01.015
Fine. Musician.

13:02.545 --> 13:04.575
Well, Sis Mai.

13:04.955 --> 13:06.135
What's your job?

13:07.315 --> 13:08.234
You're a singer.

13:08.235 --> 13:10.895
She writes online novels
so she's an author.

13:11.995 --> 13:13.015
Internet writer!

13:13.265 --> 13:14.624
It's lucrative.

13:14.625 --> 13:16.544
I saw online that
Internet writers

13:16.545 --> 13:17.975
could earn 100 million a year!

13:21.115 --> 13:22.535
Now, I see.

13:22.995 --> 13:26.135
That's why you always stay indoors.

13:26.425 --> 13:28.135
Your light is on at midnight.

13:28.425 --> 13:29.975
For literary creation.

13:30.265 --> 13:31.384
Now, I see.

13:31.385 --> 13:32.695
Indoor girl. Night owl.

13:33.195 --> 13:34.195
It matches.

13:34.265 --> 13:35.265
You write books

13:35.505 --> 13:36.655
while I write songs.

13:37.115 --> 13:40.544
Essentially, we're peers
with a common language.

13:40.545 --> 13:42.455
Let's chat more often later on.

13:46.745 --> 13:47.895
Why not speak?

13:48.625 --> 13:50.095
Why does she seem quiet?

13:50.355 --> 13:51.815
Because you're too talkative.

13:52.625 --> 13:53.625
Oh, I see.

13:53.745 --> 13:57.664
Social phobia. It's popular, right?

13:57.665 --> 13:59.335
Staying indoors too long.

14:00.425 --> 14:02.255
Well, Sis Mai.

14:02.665 --> 14:04.855
What's your pen name?

14:05.195 --> 14:07.074
I want to read your work carefully

14:07.075 --> 14:08.535
and learn from it.

14:11.745 --> 14:12.784
Sorry.

14:12.785 --> 14:14.295
I want to keep my sockpuppet secret.

14:14.835 --> 14:16.015
Enjoy yourselves.

14:17.145 --> 14:19.335
Do you want to
have anything else?

14:20.145 --> 14:21.544
No. Corns enough.

14:21.545 --> 14:23.975
I want to make myself some noodles.

14:27.905 --> 14:28.905
Well...

14:29.355 --> 14:30.355
What's going on?

14:30.545 --> 14:32.215
Sockpuppet?

14:32.625 --> 14:34.114
Why keep it secret?

14:34.115 --> 14:35.455
Privacy.

14:36.715 --> 14:39.535
Strangers stay away.

14:39.995 --> 14:41.615
Why keep it secret?

14:41.995 --> 14:44.135
Isn't it good to
promote her works?

14:44.835 --> 14:45.594
Nana.

14:45.595 --> 14:48.255
Do you know her pen name?

14:48.545 --> 14:49.545
I don't know.

14:50.195 --> 14:52.095
Do you know what a sockpuppet is?

14:52.545 --> 14:53.545
No.

14:54.475 --> 14:57.215
Damai just wanted to tell me.

14:59.235 --> 15:00.994
She must put trust in me at that time.

15:00.995 --> 15:02.255
That's why she told me.

15:02.875 --> 15:04.775
I didn't know
she's hard like that.

15:05.195 --> 15:07.234
I fancied myself clever and thought

15:07.235 --> 15:09.815
it's fine as long as I kept her pen name secret.

15:13.785 --> 15:15.135
She doesn't blame you.

15:15.875 --> 15:18.175
That's why I feel so sorry.

15:19.625 --> 15:24.175
You can't always know
your best friend's mind.

15:25.875 --> 15:27.495
Remember to treat her well later on.

15:54.355 --> 15:55.615
Good morning, Damai.

16:06.115 --> 16:07.264
What's going on?

16:07.265 --> 16:08.575
Are you still sleepy?

16:11.025 --> 16:12.424
Take it easy.

16:12.425 --> 16:14.354
It's fine for them to know you're an author.

16:14.355 --> 16:16.194
They don't know your pen name.

16:16.195 --> 16:17.195
Right?

16:18.955 --> 16:19.955
Thank you.

16:20.875 --> 16:21.875
Thank?

16:23.355 --> 16:24.855
Why do you thank me?

16:26.195 --> 16:27.455
I cried out

16:27.715 --> 16:30.335
when I read around Chapter 30.

16:32.425 --> 16:33.575
Why?

16:33.995 --> 16:37.354
The heroine thought
she would die there

16:37.355 --> 16:39.354
so she swallowed the
evidence and hoped

16:39.355 --> 16:41.335
it could be found during the autopsy.

16:43.235 --> 16:45.354
Though I knew she wouldn't die,

16:45.355 --> 16:47.535
I still cried for it was so moving.

16:56.905 --> 16:59.095
That part gets a lot of criticism.

16:59.945 --> 17:00.945
Why?

17:01.665 --> 17:05.034
Some readers think she's so reckless,

17:05.035 --> 17:07.415
while others think the hero is so useless.

17:10.625 --> 17:12.384
I think there are few

17:12.385 --> 17:14.254
romantic parts in the story

17:14.255 --> 17:15.274
but the plots of solving cases

17:15.275 --> 17:16.695
are so interesting.

17:17.945 --> 17:21.464
Why does she need
to wait for his rescue?

17:21.465 --> 17:23.415
She's powerful to save herself, okay?

17:23.755 --> 17:25.274
Besides, he's her co-worker

17:25.275 --> 17:27.775
and he's done all that he could do.

17:28.555 --> 17:30.944
I think everyone has
his or her own taste.

17:30.945 --> 17:33.754
As someone likes it, some won't.

17:33.755 --> 17:35.015
Anyway, I do like it.

17:35.795 --> 17:37.184
I'm serious.

17:37.185 --> 17:38.415
Not kidding.

17:42.755 --> 17:45.015
Thanks for your appreciation and support.

17:45.875 --> 17:47.314
Thank again.

17:47.315 --> 17:49.335
I should thank you

17:51.225 --> 17:53.335
for you haven't asked me to pay.

18:02.275 --> 18:03.275
Damai.

18:03.875 --> 18:05.655
I find that

18:05.905 --> 18:06.975
you really love cats.

18:07.875 --> 18:10.655
So I thought

18:10.985 --> 18:13.015
to send the wooden kitten to you.

18:13.385 --> 18:15.034
So it could accompany you

18:15.035 --> 18:16.535
while you're writing at night.

18:22.425 --> 18:23.874
It's so cute!

18:23.875 --> 18:24.875
Do you like it?

18:25.355 --> 18:27.055
Yes! Thank you!

18:27.515 --> 18:30.535
No more "thank you" please.

18:36.175 --> 18:38.114
How many chapters have you finished?

18:38.115 --> 18:39.135
More than 80.

18:39.465 --> 18:40.704
Cheer on!

18:40.705 --> 18:43.295
To be honest, I almost
finish reading them all.

18:49.385 --> 18:50.975
Have it first. It's getting cold.

19:27.795 --> 19:32.735
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

19:35.135 --> 19:39.775
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

19:42.535 --> 19:48.295
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

19:48.935 --> 19:54.255
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

19:57.395 --> 20:02.095
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

20:04.815 --> 20:09.695
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

20:12.115 --> 20:16.944
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

20:16.945 --> 20:17.945
Liu.

20:18.275 --> 20:19.224
Do me a favor.

20:19.225 --> 20:21.034
Ask your friend in the clothing stall

20:21.035 --> 20:22.114
when they will issue orders

20:22.115 --> 20:24.135
to a small clothing factory.

20:24.425 --> 20:25.855
Yes. Less than five people.

20:27.945 --> 20:29.975
Fine. I'm waiting for your call.

20:30.515 --> 20:31.515
Bye.

20:33.555 --> 20:39.855
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

20:41.615 --> 20:43.355
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

20:43.355 --> 20:48.194
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

20:48.195 --> 20:54.335
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

20:55.225 --> 20:56.225
Xu Hongdou.

20:57.835 --> 20:59.274
Do you want to ride a horse?

20:59.275 --> 21:00.275
No, thanks.

21:00.425 --> 21:01.895
I'm here to see them.

21:02.905 --> 21:03.935
Try to learn.

21:04.515 --> 21:06.375
When the tiny grow
up, you can try.

21:07.665 --> 21:09.335
Maybe I'm back at that time.

21:24.425 --> 21:25.425
So...

21:26.145 --> 21:27.775
you've decided to go back to Beijing?

21:28.665 --> 21:30.015
Maybe Shanghai.

21:31.355 --> 21:32.355
Yeah.

21:32.665 --> 21:33.994
Your sister is in Shanghai.

21:33.995 --> 21:35.175
You can help each other.

21:42.795 --> 21:46.455
Don't you think time flies?

21:50.875 --> 21:51.875
Yes.

21:59.355 --> 22:02.295
Have you gathered
the energy to restart?

22:03.875 --> 22:05.415
Let me feel.

22:06.425 --> 22:08.135
Not yet.

22:09.225 --> 22:10.225
But it'll be soon.

22:12.355 --> 22:13.834
So you have already let

22:13.835 --> 22:15.135
the things in your heart go?

22:20.035 --> 22:21.575
I thought to let it go.

22:22.625 --> 22:24.095
But now I regret it.

22:28.665 --> 22:29.855
And I can't do so.

22:33.355 --> 22:36.135
All that we cherish have weight.

22:37.705 --> 22:39.455
We need to habituate

22:40.225 --> 22:41.455
to live with it.

22:47.385 --> 22:48.895
We'll meet some

22:49.905 --> 22:52.575
hardships and
sufferings in our life.

22:53.225 --> 22:54.735
So that we could grow up.

22:56.075 --> 22:57.075
Fortunately,

22:58.875 --> 23:00.255
these pains

23:00.555 --> 23:01.975
could vanish soon

23:04.145 --> 23:05.575
Time will bring them away

23:06.755 --> 23:08.095
and also heal us.

23:10.035 --> 23:11.535
Time is the most uncharitable

23:12.665 --> 23:15.735
and also amiable matter.

23:30.425 --> 23:31.455
It's right.

23:32.595 --> 23:33.815
It's almost been a year.

23:35.275 --> 23:37.215
Modern life is fast-paced.

23:37.755 --> 23:39.535
Actually, it's quite long.

23:42.355 --> 23:43.655
As if it's yesterday.

23:48.145 --> 23:50.015
Do you love him so deeply?

23:57.225 --> 23:58.455
What?

23:59.515 --> 24:00.515
I...

24:01.625 --> 24:03.015
Haven't I told you before?

24:03.595 --> 24:05.704
I'm sharp-eyed, okay?

24:05.705 --> 24:07.415
Disappointed in love, right?

24:08.145 --> 24:09.144
Oh, come on.

24:09.145 --> 24:13.384
You're such a beauty
and also good at working.

24:13.385 --> 24:16.754
Why are you so sticky in love?

24:16.755 --> 24:17.895
Resigned?

24:18.225 --> 24:19.384
Is he your colleague?

24:19.385 --> 24:20.695
Why didn't he resign?

24:27.705 --> 24:28.904
Why are you looking at me?

24:28.905 --> 24:30.015
Am I wrong?

24:32.625 --> 24:34.055
No. You're all right.

24:34.985 --> 24:36.935
It's the love of my life.

24:38.385 --> 24:41.794
If so, I really need
to persuade you.

24:41.795 --> 24:42.795
I refuse.

24:44.225 --> 24:45.034
I'm back.

24:45.035 --> 24:46.274
Wait! Where to go?

24:46.275 --> 24:47.415
Back to the cafe.

24:47.705 --> 24:49.455
Don't evade it!

24:50.705 --> 24:53.175
You've gained the
power to restart, right?

24:55.795 --> 24:56.795
Xu Hongdou!

24:58.115 --> 25:00.184
♫ One step to stars ♫

25:00.185 --> 25:01.514
Dine at my home this evening?

25:01.515 --> 25:03.975
♫ One step to rainbow ♫

25:05.875 --> 25:09.095
♫ We miss and then we hug ♫

25:10.075 --> 25:10.944
Braised chicken.

25:10.945 --> 25:13.934
♫ Breeze comes ♫

25:13.935 --> 25:17.215
♫ The crush comes with it ♫

25:19.665 --> 25:21.415
Braised chicken.

25:22.035 --> 25:23.794
What about Braised Hongdou?

25:23.795 --> 25:28.935
♫ On a rainy or sunny street ♫

25:29.705 --> 25:30.664
Cut into shreds.

25:30.665 --> 25:32.055
Not chunks.

25:32.555 --> 25:34.615
I like onion chunks.

25:35.465 --> 25:37.375
Why not just eat a whole?

25:39.185 --> 25:39.704
My eyes.

25:39.705 --> 25:41.135
Please don't!

25:41.985 --> 25:42.985
Mr. Xie.

25:44.875 --> 25:45.904
Hello, Hongdou.

25:45.905 --> 25:46.905
Hi.

25:46.945 --> 25:48.314
Just in time.

25:48.315 --> 25:49.535
Dine together?

25:49.835 --> 25:50.895
No thanks.

25:51.145 --> 25:53.215
I need to have a
teleconference later.

25:54.225 --> 25:55.225
Mr. Xie.

26:00.115 --> 26:01.115
How is it?

26:01.145 --> 26:02.335
Anything good?

26:03.315 --> 26:04.655
I found you an order.

26:05.665 --> 26:06.624
Really?

26:06.625 --> 26:08.794
I called my former colleague, Shen Liang.

26:08.795 --> 26:10.114
You've seen him before.

26:10.115 --> 26:12.274
I've told him
about your project.

26:12.275 --> 26:14.655
He's willing to offer you seed capital.

26:16.515 --> 26:18.704
Get ready for the plan
and I'll set up a group.

26:18.705 --> 26:20.274
I won't interfere anymore.

26:20.275 --> 26:21.455
Fine!

26:22.755 --> 26:23.755
Well...

26:24.075 --> 26:25.075
Xie!

26:28.355 --> 26:29.355
To be honest,

26:30.075 --> 26:31.075
from now on,

26:31.355 --> 26:32.815
we're real brothers!

26:33.185 --> 26:34.215
No, thanks.

26:34.515 --> 26:35.424
Not too much.

26:35.425 --> 26:36.704
Just be cousins.

26:36.705 --> 26:38.575
No! We must be real!

26:39.035 --> 26:40.274
Oh, my!

26:40.275 --> 26:42.224
You always help me!

26:42.225 --> 26:43.594
Fine, I'll leave you to work.

26:43.595 --> 26:45.015
The meeting is waiting for me.

26:47.595 --> 26:48.775
One more hug!

26:49.035 --> 26:50.114
My dear brothers!

26:50.115 --> 26:50.514
Come on!

26:50.515 --> 26:51.515
My man!

26:51.595 --> 26:53.895
Enjoy your chicken!

27:01.755 --> 27:02.755
What's going on?

27:03.355 --> 27:04.895
Is he going to set up a career?

27:09.035 --> 27:10.375
He cares about common things?

27:10.625 --> 27:12.424
Yes.

27:12.425 --> 27:13.754
And far more than that.

27:13.755 --> 27:14.755
Far more?

27:15.795 --> 27:18.624
We've known each
other because of work

27:18.625 --> 27:19.655
for many years.

27:21.355 --> 27:23.034
Over 20 group-buying websites are online

27:23.035 --> 27:24.375
only in this month.

27:24.835 --> 27:26.215
Fierce competition.

27:26.665 --> 27:27.895
Why fierce?

27:28.705 --> 27:30.935
Because it's a promising market.

27:31.835 --> 27:33.375
I'm not afraid of competing.

27:33.665 --> 27:35.055
We're vying for the throne!

27:35.515 --> 27:37.415
The end is unknown.

27:38.625 --> 27:39.625
Bro!

27:40.425 --> 27:41.274
I want to give them

27:41.275 --> 27:43.034
a dimensional reduction strike.

27:43.035 --> 27:45.224
If they need 20 people to be a group,

27:45.225 --> 27:46.274
then I need 10.

27:46.275 --> 27:47.944
If they need 10, I'll need five.

27:47.945 --> 27:49.184
If they dare to choose five,

27:49.185 --> 27:50.895
then I could have a one-man group!

27:52.145 --> 27:54.535
Then how can you
negotiate the price with firms?

27:54.875 --> 27:55.624
No.

27:55.625 --> 27:56.895
We don't need to negotiate.

27:57.975 --> 27:59.975
We'll pay for the price difference ourselves.

28:00.515 --> 28:03.855
That's why I need
more and more funds.

28:05.595 --> 28:07.095
Pay for it ourselves?

28:07.355 --> 28:08.355
Yes.

28:09.755 --> 28:10.755
Bro.

28:12.755 --> 28:14.375
Eagles don't catch flies.

28:14.755 --> 28:16.855
We must have foresight.

28:17.385 --> 28:21.295
Do not only focus on
the pennies in front of us.

28:23.355 --> 28:24.375
Open up!

28:25.875 --> 28:26.875
We...

28:28.185 --> 28:29.354
will think over it.

28:29.355 --> 28:30.355
Think...

28:33.115 --> 28:34.115
Fine.

28:40.555 --> 28:41.895
We'll get the great cause.

28:46.035 --> 28:47.255
Group purchase?

28:47.905 --> 28:49.874
It's discussed many years ago.

28:49.875 --> 28:51.615
I'd already converted it into cash.

28:53.875 --> 28:54.895
Bro!

28:56.515 --> 28:57.735
Do you know

28:58.075 --> 29:00.015
what the most promising business is?

29:02.225 --> 29:03.615
Paying for wisdom.

29:05.555 --> 29:07.455
How can we get a consumption upgrade?

29:08.035 --> 29:09.035
By knowledge.

29:09.275 --> 29:10.975
The upgrade of immaterial wealth.

29:12.985 --> 29:19.055
Of course, I won't like
those fear-mongers.

29:19.425 --> 29:21.874
Fundamentally, I want to develop

29:21.875 --> 29:23.874
people's aspiration for knowledge

29:23.875 --> 29:26.855
and the demand for being a better person.

29:29.985 --> 29:31.395
I know what you want to know.

29:32.225 --> 29:33.225
Who will pay?

29:34.035 --> 29:35.855
Flows bring us everything.

29:36.225 --> 29:37.935
Advertisers pay for it

29:40.075 --> 29:42.215
and I'll energize knowledge.

29:42.555 --> 29:45.335
Paying for knowledge.

29:46.905 --> 29:48.655
What a great thing!

29:50.355 --> 29:52.215
I really admire myself.

29:53.225 --> 29:54.225
Want one?

29:54.315 --> 29:55.315
I don't smoke.

29:55.385 --> 29:56.754
Excuse me, sir.

29:56.755 --> 29:58.215
You can't have a cigarette here.

30:01.355 --> 30:02.355
Young girl.

30:03.075 --> 30:06.655
Let me popularize an idea for free.

30:08.625 --> 30:11.335
This is called a cigar.

30:11.875 --> 30:13.175
No cigar either.

30:15.515 --> 30:16.515
Fine.

30:25.515 --> 30:26.775
I could smell it, right?

30:28.355 --> 30:30.055
Sharing business...

30:31.625 --> 30:34.375
It must be a great
and pioneering career.

30:36.075 --> 30:37.415
Marvelous.

30:40.625 --> 30:43.874
Most of the Red Ocean business now

30:43.875 --> 30:45.335
could only solve things

30:46.075 --> 30:47.375
from the surface.

30:48.425 --> 30:50.455
You need to find its core.

30:52.355 --> 30:55.255
What is the rarest in the world?

30:56.905 --> 30:57.905
Resource.

30:59.625 --> 31:02.455
So nothing couldn't be shared.

31:02.985 --> 31:04.975
We need to share them fully.

31:07.225 --> 31:08.295
Think of it.

31:08.935 --> 31:12.255
In terms of various needs in our daily life,

31:13.555 --> 31:17.775
we could develop so many subdivisions.

31:18.595 --> 31:20.055
Gives full play to our talent.

31:23.795 --> 31:25.655
Sharing business

31:25.905 --> 31:28.295
benefits not only the economy,

31:29.705 --> 31:33.095
but also our nation,
people and even the world.

31:33.625 --> 31:35.615
What a majestic kindness!

31:37.035 --> 31:38.775
As we're friends,

31:40.225 --> 31:43.095
I want to share it with you.

31:44.465 --> 31:45.465
Seed round

31:46.035 --> 31:47.295
and angel round for you.

31:49.115 --> 31:52.175
Because you couldn't
get the price now

31:52.905 --> 31:55.015
in the subsequent rounds.

31:57.705 --> 31:59.535
When my firm is on the market,

32:00.275 --> 32:02.095
you could only buy from

32:03.225 --> 32:06.295
secondary market even
if we're close friends.

32:12.385 --> 32:13.385
I see.

32:14.035 --> 32:16.815
I'm back to have a meeting to discuss it.

32:20.385 --> 32:21.385
Fine.

32:22.275 --> 32:24.055
But as soon as possible.

32:24.625 --> 32:27.695
Chances wait for nobody.

32:29.275 --> 32:30.615
Am I right, Sharing?

32:31.905 --> 32:33.335
At that time,

32:33.875 --> 32:36.215
I'll bring you to ring the bell together.

32:42.795 --> 32:44.334
He's in luck

32:44.335 --> 32:46.034
and could cash out at previous times.

32:46.035 --> 32:46.874
Earned some money.

32:46.875 --> 32:48.135
Then he became expansive.

32:48.555 --> 32:50.424
The last time is the sharing economy.

32:50.425 --> 32:52.624
He thought he finally found

32:52.625 --> 32:54.255
a lifelong-struggle career

32:54.515 --> 32:56.354
and invested all his money.

32:56.355 --> 32:57.855
It's spoiled in the end.

32:59.555 --> 33:01.624
As he suffered a blow at work,

33:01.625 --> 33:03.224
his temperament totally changed.

33:03.225 --> 33:05.655
From success to being immortal?

33:06.185 --> 33:07.514
Immortal?

33:07.515 --> 33:08.975
No. His mind state collapsed.

33:09.465 --> 33:10.855
Anyone here?

33:13.035 --> 33:14.135
Qin's father.

33:15.355 --> 33:16.355
Brother.

33:19.115 --> 33:20.255
Hi, Yao.

33:35.035 --> 33:36.375
My grocery store

33:36.665 --> 33:38.375
has opened for many years.

33:39.315 --> 33:41.735
At that time, there were few shops here.

33:42.385 --> 33:43.495
Look at here now.

33:43.945 --> 33:45.384
Supermarkets.

33:45.385 --> 33:48.735
24-hour convenience
stores under construction.

33:49.985 --> 33:53.495
Besides, adults and
kids also shop online.

33:54.625 --> 33:57.015
It's hard to run a grocery store.

33:57.625 --> 33:58.625
I see.

33:59.355 --> 34:01.015
You've considered everything.

34:01.555 --> 34:03.375
I'm a far-sighted man.

34:04.465 --> 34:06.895
Embroidery is a good skill

34:07.355 --> 34:10.095
and also it's promising.

34:10.875 --> 34:11.875
I agree.

34:11.985 --> 34:13.754
Intangible cultural heritage

34:13.755 --> 34:15.754
needs protection and succession.

34:15.755 --> 34:18.504
So she must learn it!

34:18.505 --> 34:20.095
And she must learn it well!

34:21.585 --> 34:23.655
She listens to you more.

34:24.025 --> 34:25.155
Please persuade her.

34:25.425 --> 34:26.425
Second Bro.

34:26.875 --> 34:28.834
You can't force her.

34:28.835 --> 34:31.794
I think Qin is not interested in it.

34:31.795 --> 34:32.795
No!

34:33.065 --> 34:34.215
Go to tell her

34:35.025 --> 34:37.655
that you'll propose a marriage to her

34:38.355 --> 34:39.775
when she's good at it.

34:41.505 --> 34:45.064
Let's coax her
to learn it first.

34:45.065 --> 34:45.794
Right?

34:45.795 --> 34:46.795
Yao!

34:47.905 --> 34:48.905
Granny!

34:50.065 --> 34:50.874
Yao.

34:50.875 --> 34:52.234
Here's your braised chicken.

34:52.235 --> 34:53.235
Hi, Honghong.

34:53.505 --> 34:54.735
Hello, Second Bro.

34:56.905 --> 34:57.984
Yao.

34:57.985 --> 34:58.984
If you're now busy,

34:58.985 --> 35:00.874
we'll talk to you when we get the plate.

35:00.875 --> 35:01.754
It's fine.

35:01.755 --> 35:02.944
Just in time.

35:02.945 --> 35:04.535
He's just finished.

35:08.905 --> 35:12.775
My friends are waiting
for me to play cards.

35:15.425 --> 35:16.425
Well...

35:17.385 --> 35:19.255
Granny, I have to leave first.

35:19.545 --> 35:20.855
Take care!

35:21.195 --> 35:22.024
Take care.

35:22.025 --> 35:23.335
I won't see you off.

35:24.025 --> 35:25.255
Okay, fine.

35:25.755 --> 35:26.354
Bye.

35:26.355 --> 35:27.455
Bye-bye.

35:27.795 --> 35:29.095
Have a seat.

35:30.715 --> 35:31.715
Honghong.

35:31.985 --> 35:33.024
You've told me

35:33.025 --> 35:35.874
you want to set up a small clothing factory

35:35.875 --> 35:38.274
and I find some materials
based on your data.

35:38.275 --> 35:39.415
Then I made out a bill.

35:40.025 --> 35:41.904
The cost that you expected

35:41.905 --> 35:43.314
is still a little low.

35:43.315 --> 35:46.424
Not only the fee
for making clothes

35:46.425 --> 35:48.234
but also the fee of rental, water,

35:48.235 --> 35:49.754
electricity, machines, materials,

35:49.755 --> 35:51.714
and reworking cost.

35:51.715 --> 35:53.415
Have a look.

35:54.755 --> 35:56.335
And I know that

35:56.905 --> 36:00.295
the orders for small
factories are not regular.

36:00.635 --> 36:03.944
Sometimes rush orders
and sometimes no order.

36:03.945 --> 36:06.495
You need to prepare
for it and think it over.

36:06.945 --> 36:09.055
He's busy every day.

36:09.985 --> 36:12.674
Everyone finds him with problems.

36:12.675 --> 36:15.375
They think he's cultivated and knows a lot.

36:16.635 --> 36:18.354
We live in the same village

36:18.355 --> 36:19.895
so he tries his best to help.

36:26.835 --> 36:29.554
[Dou: So do I. My relatives ask for
my help when they come to Beijing.]

36:29.555 --> 36:31.894
[Yao: Qin's dad encouraged me
to be a love liar... So tough...]

36:31.895 --> 36:34.775
[Dou: More handsome you're,
more responsibility you have.]

36:44.275 --> 36:47.215
[Yao: Shall we have rice noodles tomorrow?]

36:53.235 --> 36:55.055
[Dou: When?]

37:00.215 --> 37:02.055
[Yao: Half past five.]

37:03.035 --> 37:03.994
[Dou: Get out.]

37:03.995 --> 37:10.415
♫ I know this. I'll be yours ♫

37:10.715 --> 37:13.575
♫ And smile ♫

37:14.195 --> 37:16.464
They said Yao's ex-girlfriend

37:16.465 --> 37:17.935
came to find him from Beijing.

37:18.275 --> 37:19.634
She lives in the yard now.

37:19.635 --> 37:20.834
Have you seen her?

37:20.835 --> 37:22.135
Ex-girlfriend?

37:22.945 --> 37:24.375
Don't you know it?

37:25.025 --> 37:26.834
She lives there and refuses to go.

37:26.835 --> 37:28.584
She wants to make peace with him!

37:28.585 --> 37:31.335
I saw they were at the riverside.

37:31.675 --> 37:32.794
Riverside?

37:32.795 --> 37:33.795
Why?

37:34.545 --> 37:36.575
What else can they do?

37:37.835 --> 37:38.835
You know.

37:39.755 --> 37:41.095
Kissed?

37:42.795 --> 37:44.874
I was embarrassed to see it.

37:44.875 --> 37:45.314
Sis.

37:45.315 --> 37:46.695
Tell me more details.

37:47.945 --> 37:48.754
Don't you know?

37:48.755 --> 37:51.314
Almost everyone in our village knows it.

37:51.315 --> 37:52.335
That's it.

37:52.585 --> 37:54.335
Someone said they're at the riverside to...

37:56.465 --> 37:57.815
Oh, no!

37:58.875 --> 38:00.504
They should do it at home.

38:00.505 --> 38:01.714
Why outside?

38:01.715 --> 38:03.674
They should pay no attention to it.

38:03.675 --> 38:04.675
Oh, I see.

38:04.945 --> 38:06.464
On the first day when Hongdou came,

38:06.465 --> 38:08.935
I went to Yao's home
to send some beef.

38:09.195 --> 38:11.535
She was dining at his home.

38:11.985 --> 38:13.104
Then I felt weird.

38:13.105 --> 38:14.314
How could a guest of the yard

38:14.315 --> 38:15.714
go to dine with him?

38:15.715 --> 38:16.611
That's it.

38:16.635 --> 38:19.274
So she must come here for him.

38:19.275 --> 38:20.735
I've already found that.

38:21.025 --> 38:24.584
Yao and she ate the
barbecue at Guanjun's stall,

38:24.585 --> 38:26.055
exchanging amorous glances.

38:27.355 --> 38:28.754
Already found?

38:28.755 --> 38:30.384
Why haven't you told us early?

38:30.385 --> 38:32.874
I went to ask Guanjun
whether they're together.

38:32.875 --> 38:35.775
Guanjun refused it so
I dared not to tell you.

38:37.025 --> 38:38.674
Everything matches.

38:38.675 --> 38:39.234
Think about it.

38:39.235 --> 38:41.634
The volunteers in the
past only did charring.

38:41.635 --> 38:43.104
But Hongdou is different.

38:43.105 --> 38:45.935
She did her best to make a staff manual

38:46.235 --> 38:48.714
and manage his shop without salaries.

38:48.715 --> 38:50.024
It's so obvious.

38:50.025 --> 38:50.274
Right.

38:50.275 --> 38:51.415
What?

38:51.835 --> 38:54.335
You... She's the landlady!

38:55.835 --> 38:58.384
A landlady is the boss's wife.

38:58.385 --> 39:02.055
So Sister Hongdou
is Uncle Yao's wife.

39:02.675 --> 39:05.794
They're unmarried
so she's not his wife.

39:05.795 --> 39:08.354
She should be his unmarried wife.

39:08.355 --> 39:12.455
When they get married,
we could have Pork Stew!

39:15.835 --> 39:17.834
I heard that they'd
been together in Beijing

39:17.835 --> 39:19.135
for several years.

39:19.385 --> 39:21.234
Afterward, Yao decided to work here

39:21.235 --> 39:22.695
so they broke up.

39:22.985 --> 39:24.584
Someone introduced several girls to him

39:24.585 --> 39:26.234
but he chose none of them

39:26.235 --> 39:28.194
because he couldn't forget her.

39:28.195 --> 39:30.024
So does the girl.

39:30.025 --> 39:32.135
That's why she came to find him.

39:32.715 --> 39:37.424
Could they get married
when my pig is mature?

39:37.425 --> 39:38.354
It's soon.

39:38.355 --> 39:39.655
I've seen that

39:39.945 --> 39:41.674
they went to find Ms. Huailan

39:41.675 --> 39:43.215
to make wedding suits.

39:43.505 --> 39:45.975
Your pig could catch the time.

39:46.835 --> 39:47.464
Could catch it!

39:47.465 --> 39:48.424
Great!

39:48.425 --> 39:49.425
Granny!

39:49.835 --> 39:50.835
Congratulations!

39:51.465 --> 39:53.375
I'm waiting for Yao's wedding wine.

39:53.715 --> 39:54.715
I'm now leaving.

40:06.235 --> 40:06.794
In short,

40:06.795 --> 40:08.944
the rumor becomes more and more detailed.

40:08.945 --> 40:11.935
Now you're President Xie's infatuated fiancee.

40:12.585 --> 40:17.575
If you don't marry, it's
quite hard to end up.

40:28.835 --> 40:29.794
Hongdou.

40:29.795 --> 40:30.795
It's for you.

40:33.715 --> 40:34.715
For me?

40:34.945 --> 40:36.255
Nice work.

40:38.155 --> 40:39.155
Why me?

40:39.835 --> 40:41.774
I'm poor and it's my only skill.

40:41.775 --> 40:43.064
It's Children-Sending Guanyin.

40:43.065 --> 40:44.384
As she holds two kids,

40:44.385 --> 40:46.015
you can have twins if put it home.

40:48.755 --> 40:50.455
Don't make more trouble.

40:50.985 --> 40:52.135
Trouble?

40:54.195 --> 40:55.195
Really for me?

40:55.945 --> 40:57.095
Don't regret it.

40:57.585 --> 40:58.544
I won't.

40:58.545 --> 41:00.455
I'm not a master
so don't disdain it.

41:01.355 --> 41:02.535
I won't.

41:03.945 --> 41:04.945
I really like it.

41:06.105 --> 41:07.135
Fine. I'm leaving.

41:08.635 --> 41:09.234
Bye-bye.

41:09.235 --> 41:10.235
Bye-bye.

41:12.675 --> 41:14.055
Why did you accept it?

41:14.355 --> 41:16.535
Xiaxia said it's his best wish.

41:16.835 --> 41:17.835
Besides,

41:17.905 --> 41:19.015
it can bring twins.

41:20.155 --> 41:21.735
But how will you end it up?

41:22.715 --> 41:23.735
End up?

41:24.065 --> 41:25.154
I won't.

41:25.155 --> 41:26.455
It's none of my business.

41:49.425 --> 41:50.354
What are you watching?

41:50.355 --> 41:51.775
We're watching the bride!

41:52.985 --> 41:54.095
Bride?

41:54.465 --> 41:55.354
That's it!

41:55.355 --> 41:56.544
Where's the bride?

41:56.545 --> 41:57.674
She's there!

41:57.675 --> 41:58.904
Uncle Yao's future bride!

41:58.905 --> 41:59.905
That's it!

42:01.315 --> 42:02.314
So unique!

42:02.315 --> 42:03.315
I agree!

42:14.755 --> 42:16.255
Who asked it?

42:16.505 --> 42:17.815
I don't know.

